OL,3,ARussia's offensive ability is broken,
OL,4,AKyiv's former top general tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine has stabilised the front line
OL,7,Fand "broken Russia's ability to
OL,8,Fadvance" by killing so many of its men,
OL,9,FUkraine's former commander-in-chief has
OL,10,Fsaid in an interview with the BBC.
OL,12,FGen Oleksandr Syrskyi made the comments
OL,13,Fin an exclusive interview, his first
OL,14,Fsince he was dramatically forced from
OL,15,Fhis post in the summer.
OL,17,FHe addressed his sacking, disagreeing
OL,18,Fwith his critics who declared him too
OL,19,F"old school" to command Ukraine's new,
OL,20,Ftechnologically advanced forces.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
