OL,3,ARussia's offensive ability is broken,
OL,4,AKyiv's former top general tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also pushed back against allegations
OL,7,Fmade by soldiers who previously served
OL,8,Funder him, who told the BBC they were
OL,9,Fordered to remain at their positions
OL,10,Feven when they were almost surrounded
OL,11,Fby Russians, leading to high losses.
